# Form fields by mouse: a click on a field label or on any cell of its
# value moves the focus there, in an edit form and in the read-only view
# of an item; a click on anything else, such as a field a new item cannot
# change (ID, Created), leaves the focus where it was.
# A click on the menu bar of a form with changes is refused as F10 is.
